# Hubcom ServiceDesk

Follow `AGENTS.md` at repo root. Highlights:

- Remote **`hubcom`** (`premtonx/hubcom-servicedesk`); PR base **`hubcom/main`**; never push features to GeistDesk unless asked.
- Tenant key: **`organizations.id`**. Stamp tickets / vault / KB / exchange / channels from session org — never client body spoof.
- Portal RBAC: `CLIENT_ADMIN` > `CLIENT_SUPPORTER` > `CLIENT_USER`. Tresor: `client_visible` default **false**; `CLIENT_USER` forbidden.
- `VAULT_ENCRYPTION_KEY` AES-256-GCM; no SVG uploads; no portal `/api/db` roles bootstrap.
- German UI; no mock fixture data in live paths.
- Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm run build`, `npm run test:portal-isolation`, `npm run test:lifecycle`, `npm run test:email-html`.
